WEBVTT


00:00:00.020 --> 00:00:03.380
Three big differences between Japanese and Korean beauty in real life.

00:00:03.381 --> 00:00:04.201
First, makeup.

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:05.140
In general,

00:00:05.141 --> 00:00:08.281
Japanese women prefer natural looking makeup with a cute appearance.

00:00:08.340 --> 00:00:11.480
This goes along with the kawaii culture that's popular in Japan.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.240
Meanwhile, Korean women tend to focus on glowing skin or glass skin.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.300
They also follow interesting makeup trends such as aegyosal.

00:00:18.301 --> 00:00:21.241
Even in everyday life, their looks can resemble K pop idols.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:22.600
Second, hairstyles

00:00:22.780 --> 00:00:25.900
Japanese women's hairstyles are usually quite easy to recognize.

00:00:25.901 --> 00:00:27.641
Usually, many of them wear bangs.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:30.140
This hairstyle is popular among different age groups

00:00:30.141 --> 00:00:32.061
because it gives the face a sweeter look.

00:00:32.062 --> 00:00:32.501
Meanwhile,

00:00:32.502 --> 00:00:35.481
Korean women tend to have more variety when it comes to hairstyles.

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:37.780
They usually prefer hair that looks thick, smooth,

00:00:37.781 --> 00:00:39.441
voluminous, and neatly styled.

00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:40.720
Third, facial features.

00:00:40.860 --> 00:00:43.880
Japanese women tend to embrace their natural facial features.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:47.200
There are even trends like slightly crooked teeth and chubby cheeks.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:50.120
Meanwhile, Korean beauty represents an ideal of perfection.

00:00:50.140 --> 00:00:53.440
This includes symmetrical faces and well defined V shaped jaws.
